.vap.co.jp/nobunagun/character/index.html\nジャック：https://www.vap.co.jp/nobunagun/character/jack.html\nニュートン：https://www.vap.co.jp/nobunagun/character/newton.html\nガンジー：https://www.vap.co.jp/nobunagun/character/gandhi.html\nキャラクター物がかなり多いので、メンバー全員を描くのが嫌なら、ニュートンとガンジーを外せばいいんです。\nよろしくお願いしうます。\n\nhttps://www.vap.co.jp/nobunagun/character/index.html", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@heartis_dq_pso2/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1142136, "client_id": 177886, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/29a4a1e7/uploads/origins/ec23b29d-ed79-4ea5-af1e-bedef0f066ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0c2c06a56e82da2052628c8ea731530a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/29a4a1e7/uploads/origins/ec23b29d-ed79-4ea5-af1e-bedef0f066ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0c2c06a56e82da2052628c8ea731530a, https://si.imgix.net/29a4a1e7/uploads/origins/ec23b29d-ed79-4ea5-af1e-bedef0f066ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=088821223ce65137777a50f48609b63f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/29a4a1e7/uploads/origins/ec23b29d-ed79-4ea5-af1e-bedef0f066ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f0926f480412390aec463d556dac7c9b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/29a4a1e7/uploads/origins/ec23b29d-ed79-4ea5-af1e-bedef0f066ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1985afc5571e9ecac1a71e5f1c62ed4c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/29a4a1e7/uploads/origins/ec23b29d-ed79-4ea5-af1e-bedef0f066ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1985afc5571e9ecac1a71e5f1c62ed4c, https://si.imgix.net/29a4a1e7/uploads/origins/e